{"id":"segu_n","lemma":"según","pos":"prep","rank":674,"glosses":["according to","as, just as, the same way","depending on"],"ipa":"/seˈɡun/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-seg%C3%BAn.wav","examples":[{"text":"Siempre juego según las reglas.","en":"I always play by the rules.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581662","words":[{"g":"always"},{"g":"play"},null,{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"rule","l":"regla"}]},{"text":"Todo salió según el plan.","en":"It all went according to plan.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152117","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"to go out","l":"salir"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"plan"}]},{"text":"Según ella, él no vendrá.","en":"According to her, he won't come.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/633210","words":[null,{"g":"she"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"}]},{"text":"Según la policía, nadie murió.","en":"According to police, no one died.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152116","words":[null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"Civility"},{"g":"no one"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"}]},{"text":"Según el informe, él está vivo.","en":"According to the report, he is alive.","words":[null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"shapeless, formless"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"alive, living"}]}]}